Create or Replace Function APLLIB/YMD2MDY (inDate Decimal(8, 0) )
  Returns Decimal(8, 0)
  Language SQL
  Deterministic
  Contains SQL
  Returns Null on Null Input
  No External Action
  Set Option DATFMT=*ISO
Begin
  If inDate > 1000000 Then
    Return mod(inDate,10000) * 10000 + int(inDate/10000);
  End If;
  Return mod(inDate,10000) * 100 + int(inDate/10000);
End;
Label on function APLLIB/YMD2MDY is 'Convert YMD numeric date to MDY numeric date';
Comment on function APLLIB/YMD2MDY is 'Convert YYYYMMDD tp MMDDYYYY date or YYMMDD to MMDDYY';
